# @-menu scene 3: subagent types. Live.
#
# `@gen` offers @agent-general-purpose (agent), from the `agents` list the real
# claude's init carries. ⇥ inserts it and a task follows - not sent, since a
# model turn needs a login this scratch HOME does not have.
Output .work/out/22-at-agents.mp4
Source .work/head.tape
Hide
Source tapes/_atmenu-take.tape
Set TypingSpeed 8ms
Type "wake new maya"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "/list-agents"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show
Sleep 1500ms
Set TypingSpeed 200ms
Type "@gen"
Sleep 3s
Tab
Sleep 1500ms
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Type "find every caller of the cart total"
Sleep 3s
